{
  "name": "HSC-01 - Push Lead to HubSpot [Prod]",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HSC-01 - Push Lead to HubSpot [Prod]\n\n**Owned By:** Ronny Kalaksanan\n**Last Updated:** 2026-08-29\n\n**Description:**\nMenerima lead dari landing page Alurio (form publik) lewat Webhook, ATAU dari trigger manual untuk testing. Validasi, lalu push ke HubSpot Contacts API termasuk field kualifikasi (proses, tools, team size, urgency).\n\n**Flow:**\n1a. WebhookLeadForm - terima submit dari landing page publik\n1b. TriggerManualTest + PrepareLeadPayload - jalur testing manual (tetap ada)\n2. NormalizeWebhookInput - satukan format data dari kedua jalur\n3. ValidateLeadSchema - validasi field wajib\n4. PushContactToHubSpot - POST ke HubSpot Contacts API (retry 3x), termasuk custom properties\n5. LogSyncResult / LogSyncError\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- Credential: \"HubSpot Private App Token\"\n- Custom properties HubSpot: proses_yang_ingin_diotomatisasi, tools_digunakan, ukuran_tim, urgensi, company (harus sudah dibuat di Settings > Properties > Contact)\n- ErrorHandler [Global] workflow (belum disambungkan)",
        "height": 596,
        "width": 820,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "cecd286d-d2de-4a2b-8c96-f10907a69171",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -512
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "alurio-lead-form",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "92265605-59c5-47aa-a3f1-64387b303f6f",
      "name": "WebhookLeadForm",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -128,
        144
      ],
      "webhookId": "alurio-lead-form"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "cc719c45-f136-459d-976f-4b41548eeca6",
      "name": "TriggerManualTest",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -128,
        336
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "body",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ { \"email\": \"test.lead@example.com\", \"firstname\": \"Test Lead\", \"company\": \"Test Co\", \"process\": \"Follow-up lead manual\", \"tools\": \"Google Sheets\", \"teamSize\": \"1-5\", \"urgency\": \"Bulan ini\" } }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c2051549-d0dd-4c47-a585-4400ecd06593",
      "name": "PrepareLeadPayload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        112,
        336
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Data dummy khusus untuk testing manual. Data asli dari form publik masuk lewat WebhookLeadForm, tidak lewat sini."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json;\nconst body = raw.body || raw;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    firstname: body.firstname || '',\n    email: body.email || '',\n    company: body.company || '',\n    proses_yang_ingin_diotomatisasi: body.process || '',\n    tools_digunakan: body.tools || '',\n    ukuran_tim: body.teamSize || '',\n    urgensi: body.urgency || ''\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "7fb5fe82-3a31-4bdf-87c3-88df907fd1d3",
      "name": "NormalizeWebhookInput",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        352,
        240
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Menyatukan format data dari Webhook (nested di 'body') dan dari testing manual jadi satu bentuk flat yang sama, dan memetakan nama field form ke nama internal HubSpot."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const item = $input.first().json;\nconst requiredFields = ['email', 'firstname'];\nconst missing = requiredFields.filter(f => !item[f] || String(item[f]).trim() === '');\n\nif (missing.length > 0) {\n  throw new Error(`ValidateLeadSchema: field wajib kosong -> ${missing.join(', ')}`);\n}\n\nif (!/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(item.email)) {\n  throw new Error('ValidateLeadSchema: format email tidak valid');\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: item }];"
      },
      "id": "0374b3ea-31f5-494a-a5bd-9711bb81a9e3",
      "name": "ValidateLeadSchema",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        592,
        240
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Hanya email dan firstname yang wajib - form landing page cuma punya 1 field nama (bukan firstname/lastname terpisah)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.hubapi.com/crm/v3/objects/contacts",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"properties\": { \"email\": $json.email, \"firstname\": $json.firstname, \"company\": $json.company, \"proses_yang_ingin_diotomatisasi\": $json.proses_yang_ingin_diotomatisasi, \"tools_digunakan\": $json.tools_digunakan, \"ukuran_tim\": $json.ukuran_tim, \"urgensi\": $json.urgensi } } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "87cb3046-b1d3-40bb-956a-08cb7c31406a",
      "name": "PushContactToHubSpot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        832,
